  "bodyHash": "FfN6LNCqYfA=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<em>身分模組</em>&nbsp;靈感源自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morph\" rel=\"nofollow\">Morph</a>，最初專為 Fabric 模組加載器開發，現透過 Architectury 架構同時支援 Forge。欲瞭解設定身分模組與其 API 互動的詳細資訊，請<a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">參閱維基頁面</a>！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本專案需在 Fabric 與 Forge 環境安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">透過&nbsp;<em>身分模組</em>，您可化身萬物：友軍或敵人，熾熱或冰冷，毛茸茸或粗糙體。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ypdqdDU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B1iV81n.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d677ur2e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d/68747470733a2f2f692.696d677ur2e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d677ur2e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67/68747470733a2f2f692.696d677ur2e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fabe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d677ur2e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/abe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345/68747470733a2f2f692.696d677ur2e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d677ur2e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae/68747470733a2f2f692.696d677ur2e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fe969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d677ur2e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2/68747470733a2f2f692.696d677ur2e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>開始使用</h4><p>欲解鎖<em>身分</em>，請擊殺周圍生物。您將於快捷列上方看到解鎖通知。接著可按 ` 鍵切換不同身分。裝備身分後，可按下「R」鍵使用專屬能力。可用能力清單請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki/Abilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">此維基頁面</a>。</p><h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#license\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>授權條款</h4><p>本模組採用 MIT 授權協議。</p>\n\n（註：已保留原始HTML結構與超連結，僅對可讀性文字進行正體中文本地化翻譯，並調整部分術語如「Identity」統一譯為「身分模組」，按鍵說明依華文區常用鍵位表述）",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
